# pytest -- testing framework of python---> build on top of unittest framework

# pip install pytest

# Naming conventions
file - Test_*/*_Test
func - test_*
class/method - Test_<classname>/test_<menthod>

### pytest -v -s -k Program
##pytest -v -s -m sanity -->custom

### predefined marker
skip---(unconditional),
skipif---(conditional),
xfail---> (for known product issues)--status: xpass/Xfail

#### fixture -- define setup, teardown

## data driven testing-- parameterise

param in fixture
param in tc/ts


